            <div xml:id="d150">

                <pb facs="0159" n="155" xml:id="pg155"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94119/414: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-04-21T16:00:00+09:00">April 21, 1938—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received April 21—6:40 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>260. My British colleague has consulted me with regard to certain alleged recent
                    conversations between Lindsay and the Department concerning the hypothetical
                    question eventual peace mediation. I have had to plead ignorance.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
